.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt MK.ATFBMK.MK 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mk.atfbmk.mk
.Nd builds the ATF that Bmake It carries
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Builds
.Pa contrib/atf-0.23
with
.Pa contrib/atf-bmk ,
using the module's compilers, once per framework build root.
It is used when
.Xr mk.atf.mk 5
selects it: always for native Windows output, and with
.Va BMK_ATF Ns = Ns Cm bundled
elsewhere.
.Pp
Not included directly by a makefile.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "scripts/atf-build.sh"
.It Pa scripts/atf-build.sh
the build; its compiler messages go to
.Pa build.log
in its output directory
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mk.atf.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.test.mk 5 ,
.Xr bmake-it 7
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Sylvain Souche
